      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسالبا الشَّىْءَ</span></b>  <i>They both contended together,
each endeavouring to seize,</i> or <i>carry off, the
thing by force.</i> The inf. n. occurs in the S and
K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خلس</span>, as a syn. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَالُسٌ</span>.]

